WEBVTT

00:02.880 --> 00:05.090
A long, long time ago.

00:05.300 --> 00:08.170
A story from about a hundred years ago.

00:08.970 --> 00:13.430
Nadja, guided by destiny, arrived in Italy

00:17.470 --> 00:18.770
- NAAJA
- Nadja,

00:18.890 --> 00:20.165
With your eyes

00:20.166 --> 00:21.439
Kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:21.440 --> 00:22.650
- Nadja,
- NAAJA

00:22.690 --> 00:23.815
What do you see?

00:23.816 --> 00:24.940
Nani ga mieru

00:24.980 --> 00:26.420
Shining in the far distance,

00:26.421 --> 00:27.859
Haruka tooku hikaru

00:27.860 --> 00:29.050
The door to the future,

00:29.051 --> 00:30.240
Mirai no tobira

00:31.160 --> 00:32.890
That's what I'm searching for

00:32.891 --> 00:34.619
Sagashite iru

00:34.620 --> 00:38.225
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:42.540 --> 00:44.290
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:44.291 --> 00:46.040
Minna egao de aetara

00:46.130 --> 00:49.380
- I'm sure there would be no more fighting
- Arasoi mo kitto nakunaru

00:49.420 --> 00:51.025
It could be so much more fun

00:51.026 --> 00:52.630
Konna ni mo tanoshi kunaru

00:52.680 --> 00:54.390
The world is wide, but it's still one

00:54.391 --> 00:56.100
Sekai wa hiroi kedo hitotsu ne

00:56.470 --> 00:58.120
I can't see the end of the journey

00:58.121 --> 00:59.770
Tabi no owari wa mienai

00:59.890 --> 01:03.230
- God is the only one who could
possibly know - Kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:03.400 --> 01:06.980
- To the people who, someday, I will meet
again - Itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:07.020 --> 01:08.085
I will go waving

01:08.086 --> 01:09.150
Te wo furinagara

01:09.230 --> 01:12.570
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:12.571 --> 01:15.910
Toki ni wa BURUU ni naru hi mo aru kedo

01:15.950 --> 01:17.305
But I won't look back

01:17.306 --> 01:18.660
Ushiro mukanai

01:18.990 --> 01:21.475
Until the day my dream comes true

01:21.476 --> 01:23.960
Yume ga kanau hi made

01:24.250 --> 01:25.960
Nadja, Your smile

01:25.961 --> 01:27.670
NAAJA kimi no hohoemi wa

01:27.750 --> 01:29.420
Nadja, gives me courage

01:29.421 --> 01:31.090
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:31.130 --> 01:32.590
Under the blue sky,

01:32.591 --> 01:34.050
Aoi sora no shita de

01:34.180 --> 01:35.595
I will find the place

01:35.596 --> 01:37.010
Ashita no yukue

01:37.300 --> 01:39.265
where my future lies

01:39.266 --> 01:41.230
Mitsukeru kara

01:46.670 --> 01:48.340
﻿A festival at night, eh?

01:48.500 --> 01:49.880
﻿Isn't it exciting, Rita?

01:50.840 --> 01:54.550
﻿Hey, hey, play time comes
after you do your work properly.

01:54.760 --> 01:57.510
﻿If you don't work, you don't play.

02:01.770 --> 02:04.140
﻿The sun is setting in Venice...

02:06.350 --> 02:08.100
﻿What a beautiful sight...

02:08.560 --> 02:10.270
﻿If only you were here with me...

02:14.070 --> 02:15.070
﻿Nadja...

02:18.120 --> 02:19.160
﻿Francis...

02:19.990 --> 02:21.120
﻿Nadja...!

02:22.660 --> 02:23.660
﻿Francis...!

02:24.330 --> 02:25.330
﻿Nadja...!!

02:32.550 --> 02:33.669
﻿Francis...!!

02:33.670 --> 02:34.420
﻿Nadja!

02:34.421 --> 02:35.590
﻿Francis!

02:36.260 --> 02:37.260
﻿Francis!!!

02:37.390 --> 02:38.390
﻿Nadja!!!

02:38.430 --> 02:40.550
﻿Huh? The phantom thief, Black Rose!

02:41.930 --> 02:44.430
﻿Kennosuke! Where did you get that mask?

02:44.810 --> 02:45.930
﻿Nice, isn't it?

02:46.140 --> 02:47.770
﻿I bought it over there.

02:48.150 --> 02:52.520
﻿The phantom thief, Black Rose, has
also appeared in Verona, following Milan!

02:52.940 --> 02:54.230
﻿Give me the Black Rose mask!

02:54.610 --> 02:55.190
﻿Me, too!

02:55.190 --> 02:55.940
﻿Give me one, too!

02:56.200 --> 02:58.660
﻿Verona, huh? It's very close.

02:58.910 --> 03:01.700
﻿Maybe he'll come to Venice, too.

03:02.830 --> 03:04.910
﻿The Black Rose will come to Venice...?

03:05.500 --> 03:07.460
﻿Skinny little girl...

03:09.750 --> 03:12.880
﻿Why don't we all wear this mask
during tonight's performance?

03:13.050 --> 03:14.130
﻿The customers will love it!

03:14.710 --> 03:17.800
﻿Why do I have to dress
up like that darn thief!

03:28.890 --> 03:29.940
﻿Geez...

03:30.190 --> 03:33.020
﻿Venice has water everywhere.

03:33.480 --> 03:35.940
﻿It'll end up sinking if it rains, won't it?

03:36.110 --> 03:37.190
﻿No way!

03:37.700 --> 03:39.489
﻿It might sink.

03:39.490 --> 03:39.990
﻿What?

03:40.240 --> 03:43.370
﻿As a matter of fact, the high tides
is commonly known as "Aqua Alta",

03:43.530 --> 03:46.330
﻿and it floods the city many times a year.

03:46.700 --> 03:51.580
﻿People are worried that Venice
might someday sink into the sea.

03:51.630 --> 03:52.710
﻿Wow...

03:52.880 --> 03:54.460
﻿It's unbelievable...

03:54.500 --> 03:57.380
﻿To think that a city as
beautiful as this could sink...

03:58.630 --> 03:59.630
﻿Nadja...

03:59.970 --> 04:03.550
﻿There are things in this world that
cannot be judged on appearances alone.

04:03.850 --> 04:06.350
﻿Things that cannot be
judged on appearances alone...

04:08.430 --> 04:11.810
﻿People really all are... just equal!

04:12.480 --> 04:13.100
﻿But...!

04:13.440 --> 04:14.900
﻿Whatever their reason...

04:15.070 --> 04:17.360
﻿Being a thief is still a bad thing!

04:24.510 --> 04:29.480
A Foggy Night - The Black Rose's Truth

04:29.580 --> 04:30.620
﻿I'll leave it to you.

04:31.540 --> 04:33.120
﻿I'm going to do our shopping!

04:33.210 --> 04:34.540
﻿Okay.

04:40.510 --> 04:43.430
﻿Mama, Mama... Mama!

04:44.300 --> 04:45.680
﻿Are you all right?

04:47.890 --> 04:48.890
﻿Yes...

04:50.940 --> 04:52.730
﻿You don't look well...

04:53.270 --> 04:54.600
﻿Maybe you should rest...

04:54.980 --> 04:57.320
﻿Would you like me to see you home?

04:57.900 --> 04:58.900
﻿Thank you.

04:59.530 --> 05:03.280
﻿But, I have to deliver this package today.

05:04.410 --> 05:06.780
﻿Um... if it's okay...

05:08.680 --> 05:12.190
Santa~ Lucia~~

05:12.540 --> 05:16.170
﻿Miss, you don't really have to
sing when you pole a gondola.

05:12.810 --> 05:16.150
Santa~ Lucia~~

05:16.400 --> 05:20.110
Santa~ Lucia~~

05:16.960 --> 05:17.960
﻿Oh, really?

05:18.210 --> 05:20.130
﻿But, it's more fun if you sing!

05:20.780 --> 05:22.129
Santa~ Lucia~~

05:22.130 --> 05:23.469
﻿You're so nice.

05:23.470 --> 05:25.590
﻿You always help your mother.

05:25.591 --> 05:30.660
Santa~ Lucia~~

05:25.680 --> 05:28.179
﻿Yup. To help my sick mother,

05:28.180 --> 05:29.510
﻿I'm going to work hard!

05:29.680 --> 05:30.720
﻿Sick?

05:30.790 --> 05:34.370
Santa~ Lucia~~

05:30.810 --> 05:34.600
﻿The doctor said that she would
get better with medicine, but...

05:34.601 --> 05:39.800
Santa~~~ Lucia!

05:34.770 --> 05:36.210
﻿We can't buy it. It's too expensive.

05:36.560 --> 05:38.060
﻿I see...

05:40.650 --> 05:42.609
﻿Thank you very much.

05:42.610 --> 05:43.779
﻿You were a great help.

05:43.780 --> 05:44.570
﻿That's okay.

05:44.700 --> 05:46.910
﻿I wanted to try poling a gondola.

05:47.910 --> 05:49.740
And... um...

05:50.490 --> 05:51.490
﻿Hm?

05:51.700 --> 05:53.710
﻿Um... uh...

05:55.370 --> 05:58.319
﻿I wondered if this might help go
towards buying your medicine?

05:58.320 --> 05:59.320
No!

05:59.710 --> 06:03.009
﻿Taking charity money from a child...

06:03.010 --> 06:04.840
﻿I didn't mean it as charity...

06:05.890 --> 06:09.640
﻿No matter how poor I am, I
don't want to lose my pride.

06:10.220 --> 06:13.220
﻿I'm very thankful for your
kind thoughts, Miss Nadja.

06:14.230 --> 06:19.400
﻿But, as a mother, I have to teach
my son the value of responsibility.

06:19.940 --> 06:23.030
﻿That's why I can't take this money.

06:33.450 --> 06:34.830
﻿That mother...

06:35.370 --> 06:37.120
﻿I wonder if she's going to be okay?

06:41.630 --> 06:42.630
﻿What?

07:08.490 --> 07:10.870
﻿What are those people?

07:13.450 --> 07:15.830
﻿Venice is like a maze...!

07:16.500 --> 07:18.870
﻿Where is this place!?

07:22.000 --> 07:23.670
﻿What is this?

07:28.380 --> 07:30.300
﻿What is this?!

07:36.730 --> 07:38.890
﻿What are you doing?!

07:44.150 --> 07:46.360
﻿Huh? Herbie!!

07:48.950 --> 07:52.029
﻿Herbie, who were those people in masks?

07:52.030 --> 07:54.870
﻿There's a festival starting
right now at Piazza San Marco.

07:55.200 --> 07:58.040
﻿The festival is celebrated
by putting on masks.

07:58.540 --> 07:59.789
﻿I see.

07:59.790 --> 08:02.500
﻿So that's why everyone is dressed funny.

08:03.000 --> 08:04.790
﻿Whew, I was really surprised.

08:04.800 --> 08:06.750
﻿It's okay to be surprised,

08:06.760 --> 08:08.130
﻿but no more punches, okay?

08:08.470 --> 08:10.089
﻿Uh... Sorry...

08:10.090 --> 08:11.840
﻿I'll do anything. Please, forgive me.

08:12.140 --> 08:13.140
﻿Anything?

08:13.930 --> 08:15.310
﻿In that case...

08:15.680 --> 08:17.640
﻿I have something I want to ask you to do.

08:17.950 --> 08:18.950
Huh?

08:28.240 --> 08:29.819
﻿Something you want Nadja to do?

08:29.820 --> 08:31.360
﻿Yes... Well...

08:31.530 --> 08:33.660
﻿Will you let me borrow her for a while?

08:34.950 --> 08:37.910
﻿Hey, Herbie... what do you want me to do?

08:38.120 --> 08:39.290
﻿You'll see.

08:43.960 --> 08:47.090
﻿Somehow, the mood is completely
different than it was during the day.

08:48.260 --> 08:50.669
﻿Don't stop so suddenly...

08:50.670 --> 08:52.090
﻿Nadja, look.

08:57.770 --> 09:01.140
﻿Everyone who truly loves
this sinking City of Canals,

09:01.440 --> 09:04.400
﻿please enjoy yourselves
as much as you can tonight!

09:08.280 --> 09:09.280
﻿Who is that?

09:09.570 --> 09:10.570
﻿Carlo Gassanova.

09:11.320 --> 09:13.400
﻿He's one of the richest men in Venice.

09:13.410 --> 09:16.620
﻿He's also famous for being active
in the development of this city.

09:16.870 --> 09:18.700
﻿Do you know about the "Aqua Alta"?

09:18.910 --> 09:22.080
﻿It's when the high tide
floods the city, right?

09:22.370 --> 09:23.920
﻿In order to prevent damages,

09:24.040 --> 09:26.289
Carlo collected donations from all over,

09:26.290 --> 09:28.420
﻿with the intent to build sluice gates.

09:29.130 --> 09:33.050
﻿Some time ago, a large bell
tower in this Piazza collapsed...

09:33.510 --> 09:35.930
Carlos is trying to rebuild that, too.

09:36.680 --> 09:38.850
﻿Oh? What a great man!

09:39.100 --> 09:42.310
﻿Well now... I wonder if that's really so...

09:45.310 --> 09:46.520
﻿Bueno sera!

09:47.310 --> 09:48.650
﻿Who may I ask, are you?

09:50.030 --> 09:51.030
﻿Oh, excuse me.

09:51.400 --> 09:52.650
﻿This is my card.

09:53.240 --> 09:55.280
﻿Montmarte Journal...

09:55.700 --> 09:57.200
﻿I'm sorry,

09:57.410 --> 09:59.700
﻿but if you want an interview,
please call my secretary.

10:02.540 --> 10:05.500
﻿This child wanted to meet you.

10:05.600 --> 10:06.150
Huh?

10:06.540 --> 10:09.999
﻿She heard about your
efforts on behalf of the city,

10:10.000 --> 10:12.610
﻿and it impressed her deeply... Right?

10:12.780 --> 10:13.280
﻿Huh...?

10:13.780 --> 10:15.490
Oh! Yes!

10:15.800 --> 10:17.890
﻿You are working so hard to save this city.

10:18.100 --> 10:19.510
﻿I truly respect you.

10:19.930 --> 10:20.930
﻿Oh?

10:21.350 --> 10:23.890
﻿It's because great men
such as yourself are present,

10:24.100 --> 10:27.350
﻿that everyone can live in
peace. I strongly believe that...

10:28.690 --> 10:33.780
﻿I would very much like to publish
this lovely story in our Journal,

10:34.150 --> 10:36.320
﻿so a photo of you
with this girl would be...

10:36.990 --> 10:38.360
I see.

10:38.870 --> 10:43.240
﻿I can't send away this young lady who has
gone to the trouble of coming to see me.

10:43.540 --> 10:45.370
﻿I'll make an exception this time.

10:47.210 --> 10:49.250
﻿Now, I have two or three questions...

10:49.750 --> 10:50.750
Go ahead.

10:51.210 --> 10:55.210
﻿Plans for building sluice gates in Venice
and the rebuilding of the bell tower...

10:55.420 --> 11:00.470
﻿People say that the reason for the plethora
of donations, were all due to your efforts.

11:00.890 --> 11:04.430
﻿Not at all, it's all thanks to
the everyone's warm support.

11:04.930 --> 11:06.140
﻿However...

11:06.190 --> 11:10.480
﻿Neither the sluice gates nor the bell tower
have actually begun construction, have they?

11:10.610 --> 11:12.270
﻿When will it start?

11:12.820 --> 11:15.030
﻿Well, we don't have
enough capital as of yet.

11:15.610 --> 11:18.320
﻿When we gather a little
more money, we'll begin.

11:18.700 --> 11:20.360
﻿Then, my last question is...

11:20.990 --> 11:23.490
﻿Has the notice from the
Black Rose been delivered?

11:27.080 --> 11:28.080
﻿Herbie...?

11:32.630 --> 11:34.590
﻿Herbie... what was that about?

11:34.800 --> 11:38.550
﻿Thanks, Nadja. I couldn't have
gotten close to him by myself.

11:39.010 --> 11:40.170
﻿As my thanks, I'll treat you.

11:40.260 --> 11:41.590
﻿That's not what I meant!

11:42.050 --> 11:44.680
﻿It was rude... to say things like that!

11:44.890 --> 11:47.310
﻿Doesn't the Black Rose only
go after crooked, rich people?

11:47.770 --> 11:50.099
﻿He didn't look like a bad person!

11:50.100 --> 11:51.310
﻿On the outside perhaps...

11:51.440 --> 11:52.440
﻿What?

11:53.480 --> 11:56.070
﻿Carlo is a famous local celebrity,

11:56.190 --> 11:58.440
﻿but, that is just his mask.

11:58.450 --> 11:59.650
﻿Underneath...

12:00.160 --> 12:02.660
﻿He collected charitable
donations intended for the city,

12:02.830 --> 12:06.120
﻿but in reality, he used
up that money for himself,

12:06.370 --> 12:08.200
﻿and betrayed everyone's feelings..

12:09.750 --> 12:12.080
﻿He's hiding a liar's face.

12:13.460 --> 12:17.960
﻿A person with a kind face
is not always genuinely kind,

12:18.420 --> 12:20.800
﻿because people can always put on masks.

12:21.390 --> 12:22.470
﻿Herbie...?

12:22.760 --> 12:26.350
﻿I don't think that the Black
Rose will let a man like Carlo go.

12:26.680 --> 12:29.180
﻿That's why, I pulled a bluff on him...

12:30.310 --> 12:33.150
﻿Carlo's response when I
talked about the Black Rose...

12:33.940 --> 12:35.060
﻿There's no mistake about it.

12:35.980 --> 12:38.530
﻿The Black Rose will appear tonight.

12:49.080 --> 12:52.000
﻿Herbie, do you want the
Black Rose to appear?

12:52.170 --> 12:53.370
﻿Yeah, I do!

12:53.540 --> 12:55.379
﻿Just by putting in an
article about the Black Rose,

12:55.380 --> 12:57.840
﻿sales of the newspaper will double!

12:58.670 --> 13:01.089
﻿Of course, even for those
who aren't newspaper reporters,

13:01.090 --> 13:04.590
﻿I believe that there are many who
wish to see the Black Rose appear.

13:05.140 --> 13:06.850
﻿I don't understand it.

13:07.180 --> 13:09.310
﻿Wishing for a thief to appear...

13:09.640 --> 13:11.390
﻿He's not an ordinary thief...

13:12.270 --> 13:14.810
﻿The Black Rose has a strong creed.

13:16.020 --> 13:17.270
﻿Creed?

13:40.170 --> 13:41.260
﻿Creed?

13:41.970 --> 13:45.890
﻿The Black Rose's creed... you mean how
he gives the money he steals to the poor?

13:46.300 --> 13:48.050
﻿That's one of the clues.

13:48.510 --> 13:54.600
﻿But I believe that, the real clue to his
creed... lies within the targets he selects.

13:55.560 --> 13:58.109
﻿People who gain riches by crooked means,

13:58.110 --> 14:01.529
﻿or people who have social positions
where the police cannot touch them...

14:01.530 --> 14:03.090
﻿are the targets he chooses to go after.

14:03.450 --> 14:06.109
﻿He is making enemies of
the rich and the powerful...

14:06.110 --> 14:08.119
﻿That is very dangerous.

14:08.120 --> 14:09.410
﻿If he is caught...

14:09.530 --> 14:10.530
﻿If he is caught?

14:10.700 --> 14:12.700
﻿It would be good if he'll
only get gaoled, but...

14:12.910 --> 14:17.080
﻿If things go bad, he would go from darkness
to darkness without ever having a fair trial.

14:18.750 --> 14:21.000
﻿You mean, he'll be executed?

14:21.340 --> 14:24.420
﻿If he didn't have such strong
beliefs, he wouldn't risk such danger.

14:24.970 --> 14:27.760
﻿I want to know what those beliefs are.

14:28.180 --> 14:31.780
﻿Regardless, I'll try for an exclusive interview
from the Black Rose, and write an article.

14:32.140 --> 14:33.390
﻿A creed...

14:35.350 --> 14:38.150
﻿People are really all equal...

14:38.860 --> 14:42.190
﻿In order for everyone to
live equally, I steal...!

14:45.110 --> 14:46.700
﻿For everyone to live equally...

14:47.410 --> 14:48.910
﻿That is the Black Rose's creed..

14:50.080 --> 14:52.700
﻿But, to steal people's things...

14:55.370 --> 14:58.460
﻿Please prepare the best vacation
home in Italy for me with this money.

14:58.790 --> 15:00.250
﻿Are you sure?

15:00.500 --> 15:02.550
﻿Isn't this from charitable donations?

15:02.840 --> 15:05.670
﻿There were more donations than I expected.

15:07.470 --> 15:09.720
﻿This is just leftover money.

15:11.100 --> 15:12.310
﻿I understand.

15:12.470 --> 15:15.730
﻿I will prepare the best vacation
home for you, Lord Carlo.

15:20.860 --> 15:21.940
﻿Wait, past here is..

15:24.110 --> 15:25.400
﻿Who are you?!

15:27.030 --> 15:28.070
﻿Black Rose?!

15:31.780 --> 15:32.950
﻿Stop, Black Rose!

15:33.160 --> 15:35.540
﻿It's the Black Rose! He
really come to Venice!

15:35.700 --> 15:36.870
﻿He's appeared!

15:39.080 --> 15:41.750
﻿To the people who are drunk
on the beauty of Venice...

15:41.840 --> 15:46.670
﻿Tonight's entertainment, is to reveal to
you the true form hidden behind the mask!

15:47.130 --> 15:48.510
﻿Gold coins!

15:49.510 --> 15:50.550
﻿They're mine!

15:52.220 --> 15:54.810
﻿Don't touch that money! It's my money

15:56.350 --> 15:58.730
﻿It's my money!!!

15:58.890 --> 16:00.390
﻿Your money, you say?!

16:00.400 --> 16:03.150
﻿Isn't it the money we donated for Venice?!

16:06.230 --> 16:08.899
﻿Let me go! Catch the Black Rose!

16:08.900 --> 16:10.400
﻿Take back the money!

16:13.280 --> 16:14.160
﻿Trying to escape?!

16:14.280 --> 16:15.280
﻿Ah! Wait!

16:15.580 --> 16:16.950
﻿Nadja, it's dangerous! Don't come!

16:20.460 --> 16:21.460
﻿Stop, damn you!

16:22.080 --> 16:25.130
﻿Turn on the lights!
Surround the Black Rose!

16:28.260 --> 16:29.510
﻿There he is!

16:40.940 --> 16:42.019
﻿Stop!

16:42.020 --> 16:42.940
﻿Halt!

16:42.940 --> 16:43.940
﻿Stop him!

16:49.320 --> 16:51.320
﻿There he is! Over there!

17:04.170 --> 17:06.130
﻿Watch out! Behind you!!!

17:23.560 --> 17:25.810
﻿Wait... why am I interfering?

17:26.310 --> 17:28.109
﻿The Black Rose is escaping towards the sea!

17:28.110 --> 17:29.780
﻿Wait, Herbie!

17:32.110 --> 17:34.110
﻿Herbie~!!!

17:41.410 --> 17:42.410
﻿This is...?

17:45.170 --> 17:47.670
﻿Mama, Mama, hold on!

17:50.630 --> 17:51.840
Who is it?

17:52.420 --> 17:54.220
﻿The phantom thief, Black Rose.

17:58.260 --> 17:59.560
﻿I can't take it!

18:00.060 --> 18:01.720
﻿No matter how poor you are...

18:01.730 --> 18:03.769
﻿It's wrong to steal...

18:03.770 --> 18:05.600
﻿That's what I've taught my child.

18:05.900 --> 18:10.110
﻿How can I, the mother who
taught him that, act differently?

18:10.280 --> 18:12.609
﻿I was the one who stole it, not you.

18:12.610 --> 18:15.990
﻿If I take it knowing it was
stolen, then I'm equally guilty!

18:17.490 --> 18:18.490
﻿Mama!

18:20.200 --> 18:22.910
﻿Right now, what do you want the most?

18:24.120 --> 18:25.460
﻿What do you want?

18:28.630 --> 18:30.630
﻿I want... money.

18:31.510 --> 18:32.210
﻿Mario...!

18:32.460 --> 18:35.170
﻿I want to use that money to buy medicine.

18:36.640 --> 18:39.600
﻿I want Mama to get better!

18:43.270 --> 18:44.520
﻿Mario...

18:49.400 --> 18:51.020
﻿Everyone is equal.

18:51.780 --> 18:54.990
﻿Money should go, not to the noble
nor the wealthy who only play around,

18:55.490 --> 18:58.030
﻿but, to more worthy people.

18:58.620 --> 19:01.780
﻿It should go to people like
you who live responsibly.

19:04.450 --> 19:07.370
﻿For the sake of the child,
take the money and get better.

19:11.250 --> 19:12.250
﻿Mama...

19:12.920 --> 19:14.050
﻿Mario...

19:15.090 --> 19:16.090
﻿Wait!

19:24.100 --> 19:26.810
﻿Wait! Please, wait!

19:30.560 --> 19:32.650
﻿Thank you! For Mario!

19:34.570 --> 19:36.690
﻿But, this kind of dangerous thing...

19:36.820 --> 19:40.200
﻿If you keep doing things like
this, someday, you'll get hurt!

19:41.530 --> 19:43.280
﻿If I fear being hurt...

19:43.580 --> 19:44.910
﻿won't be able to save people!

19:45.450 --> 19:47.410
﻿There must be another way

19:47.790 --> 19:49.710
﻿I know a noble..

19:49.830 --> 19:52.710
﻿He gathers donations and give
them to orphanages and hospitals...

19:53.000 --> 19:54.300
﻿He helps everyone!

19:56.090 --> 19:58.550
﻿That's merely a noble's hobby.

19:59.880 --> 20:01.050
﻿It's nothing but hypocrisy!

20:01.450 --> 20:02.370
That person...

20:02.390 --> 20:04.509
﻿He's doing his utmost
to make everyone happy.

20:04.510 --> 20:07.930
﻿Not merely as a noble,
but as an individual person!

20:09.480 --> 20:10.690
﻿It's just pretend.

20:11.440 --> 20:12.770
﻿No it's not!

20:12.860 --> 20:14.360
﻿It's noblesse oblige!

20:20.320 --> 20:24.870
﻿The fortunes of the noble and the
wealthy are loot plundered from the poor.

20:25.490 --> 20:28.500
﻿I'm only returning them
to their rightful owners.

20:29.210 --> 20:30.830
﻿That's my way.

20:30.960 --> 20:33.670
﻿There are good people among
the noble and the wealthy, too.

20:36.760 --> 20:39.920
﻿People can hide their
true selves behind masks.

20:40.590 --> 20:42.590
﻿That noble you know is the same.

20:42.890 --> 20:46.060
﻿Underneath the mask, he looks
down on people and laughs at them!

20:46.310 --> 20:47.770
﻿Francis is different!

20:48.390 --> 20:49.640
﻿Francis is...

20:50.480 --> 20:53.480
﻿Francis is a kind, wonderful person!

21:02.990 --> 21:04.700
﻿Aren't you afraid of me?

21:05.490 --> 21:06.580
I'm not afraid.

21:35.060 --> 21:37.190
I'm﻿... going to continue to steal.

21:40.990 --> 21:43.070
﻿What was that... just now?

21:44.070 --> 21:45.070
﻿Why?

21:48.280 --> 21:50.040
﻿How dare he!

21:50.290 --> 21:52.040
﻿And to think I was worried about him!

22:15.370 --> 22:16.995
Paris is sunnier than London

22:16.996 --> 22:18.620
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

22:18.740 --> 22:21.830
- Carmen likes paella more than pasta
- CARUMEN men yori PAERIYA suki

22:22.250 --> 22:25.335
The Queen of Spades is a fickle person

22:25.336 --> 22:28.420
SUPEEDO no jou kimagure yasan

22:29.380 --> 22:30.620
- Indeed
- Kitto

22:33.380 --> 22:35.800
- It's not use worrying about it
- Nayan datte MUDA yo

22:36.380 --> 22:37.945
Que sera sera, sera Sera

22:37.946 --> 22:39.510
KE SERA SERA SERA SERA

22:39.770 --> 22:42.125
Tomorrow's going to
be whatever it was meant

22:42.126 --> 22:44.480
Ashita nante itsumo naru you ni

22:44.560 --> 22:45.940
- To be, to be
- Naru naru

22:46.270 --> 22:48.775
The tree fog won

22:48.776 --> 22:51.280
Sekai KAERU tobi KONKUURU

22:51.740 --> 22:53.700
The world frog-jumping contest

22:53.701 --> 22:55.660
Yuushou shita yo AMAGAERU

22:58.870 --> 23:01.955
Under the kitten's paw

23:01.956 --> 23:05.040
Koneko chan no ashi no ura wa

23:05.460 --> 23:08.545
Is the scent of the sun, right?

23:08.546 --> 23:11.630
Otentou sama no nioi dane

23:14.470 --> 23:16.135
Paris is sunnier than London

23:16.136 --> 23:17.800
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

23:17.890 --> 23:20.890
- Carmen likes paella more than pasta
- CARUMEN men yori PAERIYA suki

23:21.390 --> 23:24.580
It's not the time to hang around

23:24.581 --> 23:27.770
Michikusa shite iru baai ja nai ne

23:28.650 --> 23:30.900
Indeed, indeed

23:30.901 --> 23:33.150
Kitto kitto

23:41.500 --> 23:42.920
- Tomorrow's Nadja
- Tomorrow's Nadja

23:43.820 --> 23:44.860
﻿Everyone, do you remember?

23:45.320 --> 23:48.200
﻿The guy who was always talking about
mummies, mummies and mummies.

23:48.280 --> 23:49.780
﻿The Mummy Professor, Christian.

23:50.200 --> 23:54.790
﻿In Rome, I ran into Christian, who's
on his way to explore ruins in Egypt.

23:55.120 --> 23:57.620
﻿He was going to show me around the city...

23:59.290 --> 24:02.460
﻿My mother's precious brooch was...! Oh, no!

24:03.290 --> 24:06.529
Tomorrow's Nadja. Full of
Danger, A Date In Rome.

24:06.530 --> 24:08.610
Full of Danger! A Date In Rome

24:07.010 --> 24:09.090
﻿Now, the door to destiny opens.
